Package: foxplots
Title: Point-and-Click Data Exploration and Reshaping Toolkit
Version: 0.9.0
Authors@R:
    person("Michael", "Fox", , "michaelfox0418@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
URL: https://github.com/UFSDACU/FoxPlots
BugReports: https://github.com/UFSDACU/FoxPlots/issues
Description: A point-and-click toolkit, built on 'shiny', for importing,
    cleaning, reshaping, summarizing, visualizing, comparing, modeling, and
    exporting tabular data without writing R code. It bundles reusable Shiny
    modules on a shared, unit-tested helper foundation and ships eight
    ready-to-run apps: a full Data Explorer plus focused Reshape, Combine,
    Compare Groups, Mixed Model Review, GLMM Review, Map, and Regression
    tools.
